    <string name="setup_title">Your Dark Cloud disc</string>
    <string name="setup_message">Chronicle plays from the files of your own copy of Dark Cloud. Make a disc image (ISO) of your PlayStation 2 disc, put it on this phone, and choose it here.\n\nThe US (NTSC-U) and European (PAL) releases are supported; the Japanese (NTSC-J) release is experimental.\n\nThe game\'s data, about 1.5 GB, is copied out of the image once. The image itself is left as it is.</string>
